**Variant:** `root_old_encrypt` — empty update, no new objects, trailer `/Encrypt <orig-ref> /Root <orig-catalog> /Prev <orig>`. Repoints Root at the original catalog while keeping `/Encrypt` (minimal delta vs prevchain `root_old`, which drops it).

