# 2026-10-31 — research/vps-2026-10-31

- branch: `research/vps-2026-10-31`
- cycles run: 9 (cycle 32: Track 2 O/U-empty micro-step; cycle 33: Track 2 V5-zeroed-OE/UE micro-step; cycle 34: Track 2 V5-missing-OE/UE micro-step; cycle 35: Track 2 V5-truncated-OE/UE micro-step; cycle 36: Track 2 V5-garbage-typed-OE/UE micro-step; cycle 37: Track 2 V5-garbage-typed-O/U micro-step; cycle 38: Track 2 V5-Perms-absent micro-step; cycle 39: Track 2 V5-CFM-V2-mismatch micro-step; cycle 40: Track 2 V5-CFM-None-mismatch micro-step)
- files tested: 18 synthetic appended-revision PDFs total this day (2 per cycle: aes256_r6__plain, rc4_128_r4__plain + injected page + hostile trailer `/Encrypt` direct dict), no-password probes only

## Probe counts

- t_encrypt_stdV4R4POUempty (Track 2, cycle 32): NEW variant (appended revision, trailer `/Encrypt` direct dict with EMPTY O/U hex strings, not in prevchain VARIANTS) x 2 seeds x 6 engines = 12 no-password probes → ORIGINAL 0/12, injected 0/12 — ALL six engines refuse, 0 crashes. Verdict profile identical to cycle 10 (O/U 32 zero bytes) and cycle 31 (O/U 8 zero bytes) on every stack. Fourteenth unanimous-refuse dict-typed variant; O/U-length axis exhausted (32 vs 8 vs 0 identical). Still integrity-only (LOG.md O-2026-002 extension). Builder + raw results: `/tmp/opencode/cycle32_ouempty.py`, `/tmp/opencode/cycle32_ouempty/` (2 PDFs + results.json, git-untracked by location); no new repo files, no PoC (negative result).
- t_encrypt_stdV5R6zeroed (Track 2, cycle 33): NEW variant, fresh axis (appended revision, trailer `/Encrypt` direct dict `/Filter/Standard /V 5 /R 6 /Length 256 /P -4` with 32-zero-byte `/O /U /OE /UE`, 16-zero-byte `/Perms`, `/CF <</DefaultCryptFilter <</AuthEvent/DocOpen /CFM/AESV3 /Length 32>>>> /StmF/StrF /DefaultCryptFilter`, not in prevchain VARIANTS) x 2 seeds x 6 engines = 12 no-password probes → ORIGINAL 0/12, injected 0/12 — ALL six engines refuse, 0 crashes. Verdicts: pypdf FileNotDecryptedError; pdfminer PDFPasswordIncorrect; pymupdf FileDataError; pypdfium2 Incorrect password; pikepdf PasswordError; pdfjs PasswordException/No password given. Profile matches the V4-hostile-dict family (cycles 10/31/32) — zeroed OE/UE/CF adds no new disagreement; no stack parses V5 fields into a plaintext fallback. Fifteenth unanimous-refuse dict-typed variant. Still integrity-only (LOG.md O-2026-002 extension). Builder + raw results: `/tmp/opencode/cycle33_v5zeroed.py`, `/tmp/opencode/cycle33_v5zeroed/` (2 PDFs + results.json, git-untracked by location); no new repo files, no PoC (negative result).

- t_encrypt_stdV5R6missing (Track 2, cycle 34): NEW variant, minimal delta vs cycle 33 (identical V5/R6 hostile dict MINUS `/OE /UE /Perms` — absent, not zeroed; not in prevchain VARIANTS) x 2 seeds x 6 engines = 12 no-password probes → ORIGINAL 0/12, injected 0/12 — ALL six engines refuse, 0 crashes. Verdicts: pypdf FileNotDecryptedError; pdfminer `'OE'` KeyError (retreats from cycle-33 PDFPasswordIncorrect — explicit OE lookup before derivation, the V5 analogue of the cycles-10-12 `'StmF'` gate); pymupdf FileDataError; pypdfium2 Incorrect password; pikepdf PasswordError; pdfjs `Invalid argument for stringToBytes` (retreats from cycle-33 PasswordException — attempts byte-convert of absent OE/UE). No stack treats absent V5 keys as no-encryption. Sixteenth unanimous-refuse dict-typed variant. Still integrity-only (LOG.md O-2026-002 extension). Builder + raw results: `/tmp/opencode/cycle34_v5missing.py`, `/tmp/opencode/cycle34_v5missing/` (2 PDFs + results.json, git-untracked by location); no new repo files, no PoC (negative result).
